The synergy between Ripe Protocol and Base offers several advantages:Cost Efficiency: Base’s low gas fees make Ripe’s portfolio-based lending affordable, encouraging broader adoption.
Scalability: Base’s high throughput supports Ripe’s complex smart contracts and frequent user interactions.
Asset Diversity: Base’s ecosystem supports Ripe’s vision of lending against tokenized RWAs, NFTs, and cryptocurrencies, preparing DeFi for the $16 trillion RWA market.
User Accessibility: Integration with Coinbase Wallet and WalletConnect simplifies onboarding, making Ripe accessible to Base’s growing user base.
Innovation Alignment: Both Ripe and Base prioritize user experience and scalability, creating a natural partnership for advancing DeFi.

